    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SPINNERS</strong>, you will engage in the most exciting activity of the year - clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to spin the spinner, earn points, and upgrade your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills, unlock new types of spinners, and achieve incredible speeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for all ages, professions, and social groups. It will always remain free and guarantees a lot of fun (right?).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SPINNERS</strong>, you will engage in the most exciting activity of the year - clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to spin the spinner, earn points, and upgrade your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills, unlock new types of spinners, and achieve incredible speeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for all ages, professions, and social groups. It will always remain free and guarantees a lot of fun (right?).</p>",
    "short_description": "SPINNERS. You get dropped a spinner every 2 hours 5 times per day. Each spinner is also made by the community in Discord. Come hang out with us and let's grow into something fantastic. Compete with friends, win the most unique item and become a spin master!",
